        "- Correlations found in HRV studies\n",
        "- Applications of HRV in research and practice\n",
        "- Software providers for HRV analysis\n",
        "    - PyCardio\n",
        "    - PyNeuroKit2\n",
        "    - Kubios\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
