        "\n",
        "## The HeartRateLab"
      ],
      "id": "4305883f"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "ds = HeartRateLab.Features.extract_feature_set(\n",
        "    data, features=[\"vlf\", \"rmssd\"]\n",
        ")"
      ],
      "id": "4e4688c8",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Preprocessing\n",
        "\n",
        "- Replace Zeros\n",
        "- Replace biological outliers (200 to 3000 ms) and breaks\n",
        "- Replace statistical outliers (Z(0.025, 0.975))\n",
        "- Ectopic beat detection:\n",
        "    - ACAR\n",
        "    - Karlsson\n",
        "    - Malik\n",
        "    - Kamath\n",
        "    - Custom absolute threshold (0.2)\n",
        "- Signal interpolation:\n",
        "    - Constant\n",
        "    - Linear\n",
        "    - Quadratic\n",
        "    - Cubic\n",
        "- Windowed analysis:\n",
        "    - Sliding window\n",
        "    - Overlapping windows\n",
        "    - Non-overlapping windows\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "---"
      ],
      "id": "77e10a90"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "#| output: slide\n",
        "#| label: data-preprocess\n",
        "f = Figure(size=(1200, 600));\n",
        "ax = Axis(f[1, 1], \n",
        "    title=\"Raw Data\",\n",
        "    xlabel=\"Time (s)\",\n",
        "    ylabel=\"Inter-Beat Interval (ms)\")\n",
        "n = data[1:50]\n",
        "x = Observable(n)\n",
        "t = Observable(cumsum(n) ./ 1000) # to seconds\n",
        "stem!(ax, t, x, color=:red)\n",
        "display(f)"
      ],
      "id": "data-preprocess",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "---"
      ],
      "id": "f90d5033"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "#| output: slide\n",
        "#| label: outlier-detection\n",
        "f = Figure(size=(1200, 600));\n",
        "ax = Axis(f[1, 1], \n",
        "    title=\"Raw Data\",\n",
        "    xlabel=\"Time (s)\",\n",
        "    ylabel=\"Inter-Beat Interval (ms)\")\n",
        "n = data[1:500]\n",
        "x = Observable(n)\n",
        "t = Observable(cumsum(n) ./ 1000) # to seconds\n",
        "lines!(ax, t, x)\n",
        "scatter!(ax, t, x, color=:red, markersize=5)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Detect outliers\n",
        "# xn = HeartRateLab.replace_ectopic_beats(n, method=:karlsson)\n",
        "xn = HeartRateLab.replace_ectopic_beats(n, method=:acar, threshold=0.18)\n",
        "x = Observable(xn)\n",
        "scatter!(ax, t, x, color=:blue, markersize=5, label=\"Ectopic Beats Removed\")\n",
        "\n",
        "display(f)"
      ],
      "id": "outlier-detection",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Feature Extraction"
      ],
      "id": "cf0691d4"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "names = String[keys(HeartRateLab.Features.feature_registry)...]\n",
        "println(\"Full Feature set: \", names)"
      ],
      "id": "cd8fb3cf",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "---"
      ],
      "id": "1ddb8a42"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "#| output: slide\n",
        "#| label: sequential-differences\n",
        "f = Figure(size=(1200, 600));\n",
        "ax = Axis(f[1, 1], \n",
        "    title=\"Difference of Sequential Inter-Beat Intervals\",\n",
        "    xlabel=\"Time (s)\",\n",
        "    ylabel=\"Inter-Beat Interval (ms)\")\n",
        "n = data[1:500]\n",
        "t = Observable(cumsum(n) ./ 1000) # to seconds\n",
        "x = Observable([0; diff(n)])\n",
        "x_above_zero = Observable(clamp.(x[], 0, Inf))\n",
        "x_below_zero = Observable(clamp.(x[], -Inf, 0))\n",
        "zero_line = Observable(zeros(length(x[])))\n",
        "lines!(ax, t, x, color=:teal)\n",
        "# Band above zero\n",
        "# band(x, ylower, yupper; kwargs...)\n",
        "band!(ax, t, zero_line, x_above_zero, \n",
        "    color=:teal, alpha=0.5)\n",
        "band!(ax, t, zero_line, x_below_zero, \n",
        "    color=:coral, alpha=0.5)\n",
        "scatter!(ax, t, x, color=:red, markersize=5)\n",
        "display(f)"
      ],
      "id": "sequential-differences",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
